  "statement": "Given an integer array `nums` that may contain duplicates, return _all possible_ _subsets_ _(the power set)_.\n\nThe solution set **must not** contain duplicate subsets. Return the solution in **any order**.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [1,2,2]\nOutput: [[],[1],[1,2],[1,2,2],[2],[2,2]]\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [0]\nOutput: [[],[0]]\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n*   `1 <= nums.length <= 10`\n*   `-10 <= nums[i] <= 10`",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= nums.length <= 10",
    "-10 <= nums[i] <= 10"
  ],
